<title>GERMANY: TENNIS-GRAF SUFFERS CRUSHING DEFEAT ON HOME SOIL.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-GRAF SUFFERS CRUSHING DEFEAT ON HOME SOIL.</headline>
<dateline>BERLIN 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Former world number one Steffi Graf suffered one of the worst defeats of her career in front of her home fans in the quarter-finals of the German Open on Friday.</p>
<p>Playing only her third singles match after three months out with a knee injury, Graf was swept out of event 6-0 6-1 by South Africa's Amanda Coetzer.</p>
